##Leads Tracker

A simple Chrome extension that helps you save useful links directly from your browser.

##Features

- Save a URL manually using SAVE INPUT
- Save the current browser tab using SAVE TAB
- View all saved links
- Click a saved link to open it
- Delete all saved links using DELETE ALL
- Store links using "localStorage"

Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Chrome Extensions API
- Local Storage


##How It Works

SAVE INPUT

Enter a URL in the input field and click SAVE INPUT to save it.

SAVE TAB

Click SAVE TAB to save the URL of the current browser tab.

DELETE ALL

DoubleClick DELETE ALL to remove all saved links.

The extension uses "localStorage" to keep the saved links available after reopening the extension.

The SAVE TAB feature uses the Chrome Tabs API to get the URL of the current tab.


